# Deployment validation

Run plan or equivalent dry-run (`terraform plan`, `cdk diff`, CloudFormation
change sets) before apply. Do not skip plan output when the toolchain supports it.

Validate references resolve: VPCs, subnets, security groups, KMS keys, certificates,
and remote state backends must exist in the target environment.

After deploy, run focused health checks the project already uses (smoke tests,
`kubectl` readiness, service endpoints, or synthetic checks). Report what was
verified and what was not.

Document rollback steps when a change is irreversible or lacks automatic rollback.
